### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Login (get JWT from xenticate-auth)
# POST {{XENTICATE_AUTH_URL}}/login ...
@token = REPLACE_ME

### Generate RSA key pair (EI/EJ)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/keys/rsa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "test-rsa-2048",
  "modulusBits": 2048,
  "keyType": "2",
  "publicExponentHex": "010001",
  "usage": "WRAP,UNWRAP"
}

### List keys
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Decrypt (M2/M3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/crypto/decrypt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyId": "REPLACE-UUID",
  "ciphertextHex": "DEADBEEFCAFEBABE",
  "mode": "01",
  "iv": "0000000000000000"
}
